  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">More and Better Financing in FCV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Security and Stabilisation Programme aims to strengthen local and regional resilience in fragile contexts by addressing drivers of insecurity, supporting governance structures, and promoting stability. Under this Arrangement, ODI Global will utilise the allocated FCDO grant to deliver targeted interventions that contribute to safer, more stable communities, while ensuring full compliance with financial, safeguarding, and transparency requirements. The project will focus on implementing evidence-based activities, monitoring outcomes, and maintaining strict accountability for the use of funds. Through collaboration with local stakeholders and adherence to international best practice, the Programme seeks to deliver measurable impact, ensure value for money, and uphold the integrity of UK development assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
